---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — sudoku." description="Privacy policy for the sudoku. iOS app.">
  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header class="bg-green-950 border-b border-green-800/30">
    <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-white font-semibold text-xl tracking-tight">
        sudoku<span class="text-green-400">.</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/support" class="text-green-400/60 hover:text-green-400 text-sm transition-colors">Support</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Content -->
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-950 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm">Effective date: <strong>[EFFECTIVE_DATE]</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-zinc max-w-none space-y-8 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>sudoku.</strong> ("we", "us", or "our") handles your information when you use our iOS application. We take your privacy seriously and have designed sudoku. with a minimal data footprint.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            sudoku. is designed to work without collecting personal information. We do <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or transmit:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1 text-zinc-600">
            <li>Your name, email address, or any account information</li>
            <li>Location data</li>
            <li>Device identifiers for advertising purposes</li>
            <li>Usage analytics tied to your identity</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Game progress (completed puzzles, streaks, statistics) is stored <strong>locally on your device</strong> only, using iOS standard storage. This data never leaves your device unless you use iCloud Backup, which is controlled by your iOS settings.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">2. Automatically Collected Information</h2>
          <p>
            We may receive aggregated, non-identifiable crash reports and performance data through Apple's built-in crash reporting system, if you have opted into sharing analytics with app developers in your iOS settings. This data cannot be used to identify you personally.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>
            sudoku. does not integrate third-party advertising networks, social media SDKs, or analytics services that collect personal data.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The app is distributed via the Apple App Store. Apple may collect certain information in accordance with their own <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" class="text-green-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-700" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">4. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            sudoku. does not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13. The app is designed to be safe for all ages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">6. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl border border-green-100">
            <p class="font-medium text-green-950">sudoku.</p>
            <p class="text-zinc-600 mt-1">
              Email: <a href="mailto:[SUPPORT_EMAIL]" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-700">[SUPPORT_EMAIL]</a>
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-600">Website: <span class="text-green-600">[YOUR_DOMAIN]</span></p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-green-950 py-10 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
        sudoku<span class="text-green-400">.</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-green-400 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/support" class="text-green-400/60 hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Support</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-green-400/40 text-sm">© {new Date().getFullYear()} sudoku. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
